# Diagrams: the pages for what the painter lays out. The brain names the parts; none of these has a coordinate but the map's pins.

# flow: steps and decisions joined by arrows that go round every box.
scene flow caption brisk
look paper
flow plant right | Should I water this plant?
node start end | A drooping leaf
node dry ask from=start | Is the top inch of soil dry?
node water from=dry:yes fill=accent | Water it, slowly
node wait from=dry:no | Wait two days
node light from=wait | Check the light instead
say enter=fade by=all dur=0.2s | Check the soil.

# tree: each thing drawn under the thing it belongs to.
scene tree caption brisk
look paper
tree down | Where a sentence comes from
node root | Sentence
node subject from=root | Subject
node predicate from=root | Predicate
node noun from=subject | The cat
node verb from=predicate | sat on
node object from=predicate | the mat
say enter=fade by=all dur=0.2s | Sentences are trees.
wait 0.15s

# cycle: things that go round, drawn as a ring that closes.
scene cycle caption brisk
look paper
cycle | Water, always moving
node sea | Sea
node cloud | Cloud
node rain | Rain
node river | River
link rain river | runs off
say enter=fade by=all dur=0.2s | It only moves.

# timeline: dates placed to scale along a line.
scene timeline caption brisk
look paper
timeline tl | The way to the Moon
node sputnik 1957 | Sputnik
node gagarin @with 1961 | First human in orbit
node apollo @with 1969 | Apollo 11
node programme @with 1961 1972 note | The Apollo programme
say enter=fade by=all dur=0.2s | Twelve years, then footprints.
wait 0.13s

# cutaway: a drawing cut open, every part named, the labels clear of each other.
scene cutaway caption brisk
look paper
figure heart cutaway | A heart, cut open
path body fill=muscle | M52 14 C74 10 90 30 84 54 C78 76 60 90 46 94 C28 84 12 62 16 38 C20 20 36 12 52 14 Z
poly ra smooth 24,30 38,26 42,40 30,46 in=body fill=blue label="right atrium"
poly rv smooth 26,52 44,48 46,84 34,78 in=body fill=blue label="right ventricle"
poly la smooth 56,26 74,28 76,42 58,42 in=body fill=red label="left atrium"
poly lv smooth 54,48 76,50 70,74 48,90 in=body fill=red label="left ventricle"
path aorta stroke=red thick=5 label="aorta" | M62 50 C60 8 82 4 88 18
end
say enter=fade by=all dur=0.2s | Every part is named.
wait 0.58s

# pins: places marked as pins on a route, each label clear of the others (a drawing under a map hides its pins, so this page draws none).
scene pins caption brisk
look paper
map trip route | A day in town
node station 24,46 | Station
node market 48,40 | Market
node library 62,44 | Library
node park 100,36 | Park
node harbour 128,50 | Harbour
say enter=fade by=all dur=0.2s | Labels keep clear.
wait 0.39s
